exports[`hover markdown > renders {{ items|sli‸ce }} (catalog filter) 1`] = `
"\`\`\`twig
slice(start, length? = null, preserveKeys? = false)
\`\`\`

The \`slice\` filter extracts a slice of a sequence, a mapping, or a string.

| Parameter | Type | Optional | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| start | number | No |  | The start of the slice. |
| length | number | Yes | null | The size of the slice. |
| preserveKeys | boolean | Yes | false | Whether to preserve keys. |

**Source:** Twig

[Documentation ↗](https://twig.symfony.com/doc/3.x/filters/slice.html)"
